      "writtenOn": "2022-05-10T00:40:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If only use pd_is_port_enabled(), here we won\u0027t know if the suspend is due to firmware update or caused by other module. I want to avoid blindly correct this without enough knowledge to know what other module is trying to do.\nIf the state maintained here is suspend but PD task is already resumed, extra calling of resume PD task won\u0027t hurt; and the state here will be set to resume to reflect real state too.",
